---
---
<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">about</p>

    <!-- Photo + intro side by side -->
    <div class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-photo">
        <img src="/images/nehemiah.jpeg" alt="Nehemiah" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">N</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-intro-text">
        <h2>Building the foundation<br>teams depend on</h2>
        <p>
          I'm Nehemiah, a DevOps Engineer building reliable cloud platforms through automation, Infrastructure as Code, and observability—helping teams ship software faster and with confidence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          My approach is simple: automate everything repeatable, observe everything critical, and design systems to fail gracefully. I believe the best platform engineering is almost invisible—it empowers developers without getting in their way.
        </p>
        <p>
          When I'm not improving deployment pipelines or tuning observability stacks, I'm thinking about how to make the next incident the last time that particular thing ever goes wrong.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">99.9%</span>
          <span class="stat-label">SLA maintained</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">50+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">pipelines shipped</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">unsolved incidents</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Photo + intro row */
  .about-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .about-photo {
    position: relative;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .about-photo img {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: block;
  }
  .photo-placeholder {
    display: none;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--accent-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--purple-100);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .about-intro-text h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .about-intro-text p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* Remaining text + stats row */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 200px;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .about-text p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.975rem;
  }
  .about-text h2 { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  .about-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .about-photo, .about-photo img, .photo-placeholder { width: 100px; height: 100px; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .about-stats { flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; position: static; }
    .stat-card { flex: 1; min-width: 120px; }
  }
</style>